  "Id": "299a07d5-54ef-570a-897b-50c617da3b7d"/*PhysicsDominoRunExample*/,
  "Description": "A row of fourteen dominoes toppled by the first one.\n\nThe first [RigidBody] starts tilted past its tipping point, falls onto its neighbour and sets off the chain. The dominoes only touch each other and the static ground.\n\nAKA: toppling, chain reaction, stacking\n\nTips\n- Rotation on a [RigidBody] sets the starting orientation.\n- Reduce the spacing to make the chain faster, or enlarge it until the chain stops.",
